OL,3,GNEWSA'I use a bowl to wash myself and  
OL,4,AI'm #400 in debt - energy price rise   
OL,5,Ascares me'                             
OL,7,FA woman who no longer cooks hot meals, 
OL,8,Fand washes herself using a bowl to save
OL,9,Fmoney, says the thought of a big rise  
OL,10,Fin the cost of energy from January has 
OL,11,Fsent her anxiety "through the roof".   
OL,13,FHolly, who is 49 and has serious health
OL,14,Fconditions, said she already owes her  
OL,15,Felectricity provider #400, and has been
OL,16,Fwearing layers to cut back on heating  
OL,17,Fat home.                               
OL,19,F"You shouldn't have to live like this,"
OL,20,Fshe said. "I feel like we're going     
OL,21,Fbackwards to when they were giving out 
OL,22,Frations after the war - it's scary."   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
